{"content":[{"c":["BIGVAI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Ancestor of a group of people who returned to Jerusalem with Zerubbabel after the Babylonian exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.2,14","r":"Ezra.2.2,14","rawR":"Ezra.2.2,14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.2,14","value":"Ezra.2.2,14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:2, 14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.7,19","r":"Neh.7.7,19","rawR":"Neh.7.7,19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.7,19","value":"Neh.7.7,19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:7, 19"},"). Since his name is Persian, Bigvai may have been born or renamed during the exile."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Political leader who signed Ezra’s covenant of faithfulness to God with Nehemiah and others after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.16","r":"Neh.10.16","rawR":"Neh.10.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.16","value":"Neh.10.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:16"},"); possibly a representative for the family descended from #1 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Bigvai","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:2, 14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.2,14","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.2,14","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.2,14"},{"anchorText":"Neh 7:7, 19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.7.7,19","rawQueryValue":"Neh.7.7,19","sourceRefExact":"Neh.7.7,19"},{"anchorText":"Neh 10:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.10.16","rawQueryValue":"Neh.10.16","sourceRefExact":"Neh.10.16"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"fb7446e39a5bf38b8b996cc9f599971d29544e983c72344217e48927d0818821","sourceItemName":"Bigvai","sourceItemOrder":311,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Bigvai","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Bigvai","title":"Bigvai","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}